      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管别人怎么说，\n我们都有义务让世人……\n还有那个人认可我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0670150e4916b384a0a9be16e60a907292cf4df17940c2a97163c5aec6bff064",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
