      "uid": "zhcn:a6bfbd4b4474fa9b2e28d37d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在说出“妈妈”这个词汇的瞬间，\n她的眼中浮现出一道寒光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "994b6487c0db329023dcc1c4472670cb004fd0124d56ac58a94460802df0e5c1",
