      "uid": "zhcn:3aee334beb89cea881e4786e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……气槽的这句话，\n也和圣王光环的眼神一样，\n令我十分在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4039994d23f57c097265fc51e975aefa0cba344eb928590eef58bcf85d32d51c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061113.json",
      "json_path": [
